  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="14">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> 14</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And se þe sitte úncwydd ⁊ uncraford on his áre on life, þæt nan mann on his yrfenuman se spéce æfter his dǽge.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if a man dwells on his property free from claims and charges during his lifetime, no-one shall bring an action against his heirs after his death.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et qui permanet sine crauatione et calumpnia in pace sua dum uiuit, nemo super heredes eius loquatur inde post mortem.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
